Package: bun
Version: 1.4.0
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Alienkrishn [Anon4You]
Depends: npm
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://bun.sh
Description: Incredibly fast JavaScript runtime, bundler, test runner and package manager
 Bun is an all‑in‑one JavaScript/TypeScript toolkit. This package
 installs the official native Android build through npm, so no
 glibc wrapper or manual binary patching is required.
